// Tessellation demo scene
// LEGEND:
// - NewObject [required] = Start describing a new object
// - StaticLODs [required] = The number of static LODs (at least 3) and their .obj file paths
// - Bezier [required] = The .bpt file path containing the control points for the object's bezier surfaces
// - Position [optional] = 3 floats defining the object's position in the world
// - Rotation [optional] = 3 floats defining the object's rotation angle around each axis (x, y, z)
// - Scale [optional] = 3 floats scale of the object around 3 axes
// - MinMaxDistance [optional] = 2 floats defining the min-max distance at which to display LOD0 and the highest LOD
// - TessExtremesOuter [optional] = 4 floats that represent the min-max outer tessellation levels for the DYNAMIC and BEZIER techniques (in this order)
// - TessExtremesInner [optional] = 4 floats that represent the min-max inner tessellation levels for the DYNAMIC and BEZIER techniques (in this order)
// - EarlyBackfaceCulling [optional] = 0/1 depending on whether to activate early backface culling on the object (default: 1)
// - StaticBuffer [optional] = a float describing the buffer size for LOD boundaries when moving backwards, used to avoid flickering
// - EndObject [required] = Ends the object

NewObject
StaticLODs 3 ./models/teapot_surface0.obj ./models/teapot_surface1.obj ./models/teapot_surface2.obj
Bezier ./models/teapot_bezier.bpt
Position 0.0 -2.0 0.0
MinMaxDistance 12.0 36.0
TessExtremesOuter 0.1 16.0 3.0 64.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 2.0 3.0 56.0
EarlyBackfaceCulling 0
EndObject

NewObject
StaticLODs 4 ./models/gumbo_surface0.obj ./models/gumbo_surface1.obj ./models/gumbo_surface2.obj ./models/gumbo_surface3.obj
Bezier ./models/gumbo.bpt
Position 10.0 -2.0 0.0
Rotation -90.0 0.0 90.0
Scale 0.2 0.2 0.2
MinMaxDistance 12.0 36.0
TessExtremesOuter 0.1 16.0 3.0 64.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 2.0 3.0 56.0
EarlyBackfaceCulling 0
EndObject

NewObject
StaticLODs 4 ./models/teaspoon_surface0.obj ./models/teaspoon_surface1.obj ./models/teaspoon_surface2.obj ./models/teaspoon_surface3.obj
Bezier ./models/teaspoon_bezier.bpt
Position -10.0 -2.0 0.0
Rotation -90.0 0.0 0.0
Scale 4.0 4.0 4.0
TessExtremesOuter 0.1 16.0 3.0 16.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 2.0 3.0 16.0
EarlyBackfaceCulling 0
EndObject
